# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The state, inputs, logs, and duration of each task, filterable by the stage tags `map`, `optimize`, `execute`, and `post-process`.\n"
msgstr "L'état, les entrées, les journaux et la durée de chaque tâche, filtrables par les étiquettes d'étape `map`, `optimize`, `execute` et `post-process`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
