"| SQD | Subspace Dimension | `1000000` |\n"
"| SQD | Batch Number | `4` |\n"
"| SQD | Max Iteration | `5` |\n"
"| SQD | Carryover Fraction | `0.5` |\n"
"| SQD | Checkpoint Recovery | On |\n"
"| &mdash; | Advanced Settings Block | `sqd-advanced-settings` |\n"

